        -:   50: * asynchronous operations are performed within the same implicit or explicit
        -:   51: * strand.
        -:   52: *
        -:   53: * @par Example
        -:   54: * To use the SSL stream template with an ip::tcp::socket, you would write:
        -:   55: * @code
